          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s143",
                "printed_page": "57",
                "text": "The mighty of the awe-inspiring people (Israel) swear allegiance aloud: The Lord is King.",
                "page_start": true
              }
            ],
            "reference_unit": "stanza",
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/1"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 2,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s143",
                "printed_page": "57",
                "text": "Those formed in lightning bless Thee aloud: The Lord has reigned.",
                "page_start": true
              }
            ],
            "reference_unit": "stanza",
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/2"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 3,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s143",
                "printed_page": "57",
                "text": "The strong and lofty raise their voice aloud: The Lord will reign. The Lord is King, the Lord has reigned, The Lord will reign for ever and ever.",
                "page_start": true
              }
            ],
            "reference_unit": "stanza",
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/3"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 4,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s143",
                "printed_page": "57",
                "text": "The fiery in their haste utter aloud: The Lord is King.",
                "page_start": true
              }
            ],
            "reference_unit": "stanza",
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/4"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 5,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s143",
                "printed_page": "57",
                "text": "The massed multitude praise aloud: The Lord has reigned.",
                "page_start": true
              }
            ],
            "reference_unit": "stanza",
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/5"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 6,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s143",
                "printed_page": "57",
                "text": "And the hosts and the Hayoth testify aloud: The Lord will reign. The Lord is King, the Lord has reigned, The Lord will reign for ever and ever.",
                "page_start": true
              }
            ],
            "reference_unit": "stanza",
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/6"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 7,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s143",
                "printed_page": "57",
                "text": "Chanters of psalms sing aloud: The Lord is King.",
                "page_start": true
              }
            ],
            "reference_unit": "stanza",
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/7"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 8,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s143",
                "printed_page": "57",
                "text": "The wise in mysteries confirm aloud: The Lord has reigned.",
                "page_start": true
              }
            ],
            "reference_unit": "stanza",
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/8"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 9,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s143",
                "printed_page": "57",
                "text": "Princes in heaven glorify aloud: The Lord will reign. The Lord is King, the Lord has reigned, The Lord will reign for ever and ever.",
                "page_start": true
              }
            ],
            "reference_unit": "stanza",
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/9"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 10,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s143",
                "printed_page": "57",
                "text": "Heirs of the precious teaching affirm aloud: The Lord is King.",
                "page_start": true
              }
            ],
            "reference_unit": "stanza",
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/10"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 11,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s143",
                "printed_page": "57",
                "text": "The mighty in strength pay homage aloud: The Lord has reigned.",
                "page_start": true
              }
            ],
            "reference_unit": "stanza",
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/11"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 12,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s143",
                "printed_page": "57",
                "text": "Those enveloped in flames give thanks aloud: The Lord will reign. The Lord is King, the Lord has reigned, The Lord will reign for ever and ever.",
                "page_start": true
              }
            ],
            "reference_unit": "stanza",
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:adirei_ayummah/12"
          },
          {
            "paragraph": 13,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s143",
                "printed_page": "57",
                "text": "They who speak pleasing words say aloud: The Lord is King.",
                "page_start": true
              }
