          },
          {
            "paragraph": 18,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s145",
                "printed_page": "58",
                "text": "The hosts of Thy flock let it ring out aloud: The Lord will reign. The Lord is King, the Lord has reigned, The Lord will reign for ever and ever.",
